        "event_id": "lite_evt_02158",
        "explanation": "The final doctor-visible plan leaves the case safely open with continued monitoring and return contact after ICU updates.",
        "quote": "有动静或者问完医生了随时叫我"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode remains open because the patient is still in ICU with pending reports and evolving respiratory/neuro status, but the family has clear actions: keep phone available, await ICU communication, ask prepared questions, and escalate immediately if called.",
    "label": "valid_open",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
