          "explanation": "After evolving respiratory details, the doctor explicitly changed priority to vital signs/airway before other questions.",
          "quote": "请记住这个顺序：生命体征永远排第一"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by persistent coma, oxygen use, sputum, and possible intubation risk. The doctor explicitly reprioritized from medication/result confusion to respiratory and oxygen safety first, while keeping EEG, labs, and cardiac issues in the follow-up list.",
