          "quote": "发在群里统一回复一次，之后谁再追问，您不用再逐条解释"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by caregiver fatigue, family misunderstanding, and staged ICU updates. The doctor repeatedly used written question lists, family group messaging, phone/shift monitoring, caregiver rotation, and teach-back/recording strategies matched to ICU workflow.",
