          "quote": "血氧掉、痰堵吸不出、呼吸费力让你们签插管，马上签"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 is met: recurrent seizure, impaired consciousness, oxygen/breathing deterioration, sputum obstruction, infection/metabolic/cardiac concerns, and sudden ICU calls were treated as immediate nurse/doctor escalation rather than routine waiting.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
