          "quote": "正在等哪些关键的检查结果？大概什么时候能出来？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met: the doctor avoided inventing missing results and built a plan to ask ICU/neurology/cardiology about EEG, imaging, labs, coagulation, glucose/electrolytes, renal/liver function, and cardiac consultation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor set the NPO safety boundary clearly.",
          "quote": "请家属千万不要因为心疼老人饿着就偷偷喂东西"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00837",
          "explanation": "The doctor directed medication decisions to inpatient teams and prohibited family-driven changes.",
          "quote": "家属绝不自己加药、停药或拿外面的意见去要求改方案"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 is met: the doctor addressed antiepileptic/sedative medication confusion, NPO/aspiration risk, diabetes/metabolic monitoring, and warned the family not to give food, water, oral/home medicines, or alter inpatient drugs independently.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00355",
          "explanation": "The doctor supplied a same-day/next-round family checklist covering neuro, respiratory, labs, and cardiology questions.",
          "quote": "您就盯着问这三句，照着念就行"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 is met: the doctor repeatedly provided tailored checklists with timing, ICU/neurology/cardiology ownership, immediate-call thresholds, and backup strategies such as asking clinicians to speak slowly and repeating back.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00067",
          "explanation": "The doctor incorporated the neck central-line concern and gave warning signs to ask about.",
          "quote": "穿刺的地方有没有渗血或者红肿？"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00979",
          "explanation": "The doctor set a clear boundary not to manipulate tubes, drugs, or equipment.",
          "quote": "不要自己去动任何管子、药或设备"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 is met: after the neck/deep venous line surfaced, the doctor explained its ICU purpose, warned about bleeding/redness/swelling, and repeatedly told the family not to manipulate tubes or equipment and to leave line care to staff.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
